          "_name": "testimonials3",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"testimonails3 carousel slide testimonials-slider\" group=\"Testimonials\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"BootstrapCarouselSwipe,mbr-testimonials-slider\" data-interval=\"false\" data-bs-interval=\"false\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"fullWidth\" title=\"Full Width\">\n        <input type=\"range\" title=\"Padding Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" inline>\n        <input type=\"range\" title=\"Padding Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" inline>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Author Name\" name=\"showName\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Author Title\" name=\"showDesk\" checked>\n        <header>Slides</header>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Items\" name=\"testimonialsSlides\" min=\"1\" max=\"20\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Autoplay\" name=\"showAutoplay\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Interval\" name=\"interval\" min=\"1\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"5000\" condition=\"showAutoplay\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#eae7dc\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.9\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"text-center\" mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <h3 class=\"mb-4 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>Voices of Recognition</b></h3>\n\n        <div class=\"carousel slide\" role=\"listbox\" data-pause=\"true\" data-keyboard=\"false\" data-ride=\"{{showAutoplay ? 'carousel' : 'false'}}\" data-bs-ride=\"{{showAutoplay ? 'carousel' : 'false'}}\" data-interval=\"{{showAutoplay ? interval*1000 : 'false'}}\" data-bs-interval=\"{{showAutoplay ? interval*1000 : 'false'}}\">\n            <div mbr-list mbr-list-grow=\"testimonialsSlides\" class=\"carousel-inner\">\n                <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n                    <div class=\"user col-md-8\">\n                        <div class=\"user_image\">\n                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-400x267.webp\" alt>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"user_text mb-4\">\n                            <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".user_text\">\n                                \"I believe that code is only as powerful as the problem it solves. My goal is to combine technical precision with clear communication to build software that makes a real-world impact.\"\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_name mbr-fonts-style mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showName\" data-app-selector=\".user_name\"><b>Shouri Jalandar</b></div>\n                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_desk mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDesk\" data-app-selector=\".user_desk\">Aspiring Software Engineer</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n                    <div class=\"user col-md-8\">\n                        <div class=\"user_image\">\n                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/whatsapp20image202026-01-1820at206.20.0320pm-400x423.webp\" alt>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"user_text mb-4\">\n                            <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".user_text\">\n                                \"Representing S.B. Jain at the Engineering India Speech competition was a milestone in my journey. It taught me that an engineer's greatest tool is the ability to articulate a vision.\"\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_name mbr-fonts-style mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showName\" data-app-selector=\".user_name\"><b>Competition Achievement</b></div>\n                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_desk mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDesk\" data-app-selector=\".user_desk\">Public Speaking &amp; Leadership</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n                    <div class=\"user col-md-8\">\n                        <div class=\"user_image\">\n                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/screenshot202026-01-1820182224-400x508.webp\" alt>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"user_text mb-4\">\n                            <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".user_text\">\n                                \"Innovation is the result of logical thinking meeting creative communication.\"\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_name mbr-fonts-style mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showName\" data-app-selector=\".user_name\"><b>Shouri Jalandar</b></div>\n                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_desk mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDesk\" data-app-selector=\".user_desk\">CSE Student</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div></div>\n\n            <div class=\"carousel-controls\">\n                <a class=\"carousel-control-prev\" role=\"button\" data-slide=\"prev\" data-bs-slide=\"prev\">\n                    <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-arrow-prev mbr-iconfont\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"sr-only visually-hidden\">Previous</span>\n                </a>\n\n                <a class=\"carousel-control-next\" role=\"button\" data-slide=\"next\" data-bs-slide=\"next\">\n                    <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-arrow-next mbr-iconfont\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"sr-only visually-hidden\">Next</span>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
